<title>POLAND: Commerzbank to up BRE stake-paper.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank to up BRE stake-paper.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Commerzbank wants to raise its current 21 percent stake in Bank Rozwoju Exportu SA (BRE) and has already filed an appropriate application to the Polish central bank, the Parkiet daily said on Saturday.</p>
<p>It said the National Bank of Poland confirmed it had received the Commerzbank request but declined to say what stake the German bank was seeking in BRE.</p>
<p>It gave no further details and no officials at BRE or NBP were immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
